// Parameters in a shell block expand bare or braced, and stay verbatim inside
// single quotes, each block read as written. Every block but the last stands
// before another root form, a stray refused where it stands; the last is a
// definition's body, which the lowering admits no shell block for yet (#1057).

/// A parameter and an escape inside single quotes, kept verbatim, a stray.
@[ refuses("OutOfFragment.WrongSort.declaration") ]
#!{ printf 'literal $x and \n stay verbatim'; }

/// One parameter, bare and braced, a stray.
@[ refuses("OutOfFragment.WrongSort.declaration") ]
#!{ echo $HOME ${HOME}; }

/// Braced parameters joined to a word and to each other, in a definition
/// (#1057).
@[ refuses("OutOfFragment.shell_block") ]
def joined() -> -F Unit { #!{ echo ${prefix}_suffix ${x}${y}; } }
